From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] 0149: blueline Wi-Fi stage 2: boot the modem (MBA self-auth +
 MPSS) from the phone's own modem partition (bluewifi=3)

The WCN3990's firmware runs on the modem DSP, so Wi-Fi starts with the
MPSS. SDM845 boots it by MBA self-authentication, not TZ PAS: the phone's
DTB has qcom,pil-q6v55-mss with qcom,pil-self-auth and no PAS id, mainline
binds blueline to qcom,sdm845-mss-pil (sdm845_mss: need_mem_protection,
has_alt_reset), and stage 1 saw TZ fail PAS is_supported(4) with
0xffcfffc0. The only TZ call needed is MP_ASSIGN (0x0c/0x16, available).
ios-flame used PAS id 4 because SM8150 is a PAS target.

bluewifi=3 runs the stage 1 SCM queries and then bluewifi_step (default 1):
  1  read only, one block per mapping, a log line before each first read:
     GCC mss branches, PDC sync reset, AOSS MSS restart (never WCSS),
     RMB/QDSP6SS if mss_cfg_ahb is on, TCSR halt ports and mutex 3, GICD
     pending for the modem watchdog, the AOP QMP descriptor, the apps-modem
     and global SMEM partitions (items 428/435/421), cmd-db mx/cx/mss/xo;
     then FAT16 /IMAGE of bluewifi_fw (modem_b, or modem_a) through the new
     read-only sweet_ufs_read_part: MBA.MBN and MODEM.MDT with SHA-256,
     every program header checked against the MPSS region and every
     MODEM.Bnn size.
  2  QMP link + "load_state modem on", RPMh mx/cx/mss (>= level 385, as
     the phone's DT) and xo.lvl, GCC votes and the MSS branches.
  3  SMP2P outbound item 428 (before the modem runs), MBA copied to
     0x98500000, MP_ASSIGN MPSS and MBA to MSS, PDC/alt/AOSS reset pulse,
     RMB image, QDSP6SS sleep clock + boot FSM, PBL (1 s), MBA (5 s).
  4  metadata (header + hash, 0x20dc bytes) at 0xf2600000 assigned to MSS
     for META_DATA_READY (1 s) and back; MPSS back to HLOS, shared while 30
     segments (64 MiB, 1 MiB write-combined windows, unmapped after) are
     read from UFS; MPSS to MSS, AUTH_COMPLETE (10 s), SMP2P ready (5 s),
     MBA reclaimed; a thread then logs the modem state, the SSR ack, the
     watchdog and SMEM 421 for bluewifi_watch s (90).
Failure after the boot FSM: AXI halt, reset, every region reclaimed whose
ownership is known; a region whose MP_ASSIGN failed is never touched again.
No rmtfs: the modem is expected to stop on missing EFS ~40 s after ready.

Nothing is written to UFS; EFS/persist are on LUN 5, unreachable here.
---
 bsd/dev/blueline_wifi.c | 1637 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 bsd/dev/sweet_ufs.c     |   67 +-
 2 files changed, 1681 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

diff --git a/bsd/dev/blueline_wifi.c b/bsd/dev/blueline_wifi.c
--- a/bsd/dev/blueline_wifi.c
+++ b/bsd/dev/blueline_wifi.c
@@ -1,9 +1,15 @@
