+ *                the ELF program headers.
+ *     step 2     power, no resets, no TrustZone: AOP QMP "load_state modem
+ *                on", RPMh mx/cx/mss/xo proxy votes, the MSS GCC clocks.
+ *     step 3     the SMP2P outbound item, MBA copied into its carve-out,
+ *                MP_ASSIGN of the MPSS and MBA regions to the modem, the
+ *                MSS resets, the QDSP6 boot FSM, and the PBL/MBA status.
+ *     step 4     MPSS: metadata authentication, the 30 segments (about 64
+ *                MiB, read from UFS straight into the MPSS carve-out),
+ *                AUTH_COMPLETE, the SMP2P "ready" bit, then a watcher thread
